                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Wargamers beware, this a game, not a wargame. Ignore the war-like window dressing, this is the product of poor, lazy programmers with only a vague idea of the conflict this game purports to represent.  When you run into the proposterous KV6 Land Battleship, you know they had no intention of delivering the wargame they advertized.\n    The software crashes so badly that cntrl/alt/delete often fails to boot, forcing you to pull the plug/battery (in 30 hours, I had to pull the battery 5 times).\n    The KV-2 is rated with a 4 space range, but it will shoot at least 6 spaces to kill your units.  Other units will shoot farther than they tell you they will.  Other than that, the unit statistics are utterly absurd.",
